    "verdict": "No tested ordinary-filesystem primitive enforces an atomic expected-version precondition for an existing note against an independent external writer. Content hash, mtime+size, hash-then-rename, renameatx_np(RENAME_SWAP), advisory locks, exclusive claim files and vnode observation all lost an external or ABA change; descriptor-relative traversal contains a root swap but does not bind the user-visible root. Keep automatic and engine-applied reviewed replacement for existing notes on ordinary folders disabled and retain the proposed diff for manual application. O_EXCL supports create-only no-clobber. Cloud-backed folder paths were not validated and remain unsupported."
  },
